t cap is spent the gateway answers 429 at the edge — without waking the service behind it\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The claim exactly matches the reference text's statement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Requests are counted against the credential that presented them\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"over a fixed window of 60 seconds\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states the 60-second window.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"never against a connection\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states requests are never counted against a connection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Opening a second socket therefore buys a caller nothing\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a client spread across multiple worker processes is throttled at exactly the point a single process would have been\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The claim about eight processes is covered by the more general statement about multiple processes.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not mention paying for extra file descriptors.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The default allowance is 100 requests in a window.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A credential marked for batch work is allowed 1000 in the same window.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A refusal is not an outage\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Callers that retry immediately are the largest single reason the cap is there at all.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this with 'retry immediately' synonymous to 'retry at once'.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The refusal carries a Retry-After header.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Its value is a whole number of seconds to wait.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this about the header value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Waiting that long and then continuing is the whole of the contract\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      