\n      \"evidence\": \"The gateway has already done that arithmetic, with information the caller does not have\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-024\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and it does the same on the 503 path\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states the gateway does the same arithmetic on the 503 path.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-025\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A wait derived on the client side is a guess about a counter it cannot see.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-026\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A 200 wants nothing\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-027\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a 429 wants the stated wait\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-028\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a 500 may be retried once that wait has passed\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-029\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and a 503 is the overload path\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-030\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The four cases are not interchangeable.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-031\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A client that folds every non-success into one branch will retry hardest during exactly the incident the cap was installed to survive.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-032\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A batch credential is allowed fifty times the default allowance\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this in the How to retry well section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-033\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and it is measured over exactly the same window\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this about batch credentials.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-034\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The tier is set on the credential when it is issued\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-035\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and cannot be asked for per call\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-036\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Nothing else about the two tiers differs in any way.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-037\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A caller that cannot say how often it was refused last week cannot argue for a larger cap\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-038\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and nobody at the far end will assemble that argument on its behalf\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-039\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The log line should carry the credential, the window and the wait.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-040\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The gateway refuses a request for three reasons\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-041\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and only one of them is the one above\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states one of the three reasons is the rate cap mentioned above.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-042\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A credential may be suspended\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-043\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a route may be closed for maintenance\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-044\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"or a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-045\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"None of those three clears itself by waiting for a stated number of seconds.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this about the three non-rate-cap refusal reasons.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-046\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-047\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and the log afterwards shows nothing at all except a long run of refusals\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-048\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Reading the status code rather than the class it belongs to is what separates the two cases\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-049\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and it costs one comparison\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-050\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A cap can be raised\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-051\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\