\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-034\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and the log afterwards shows nothing at all except a long run of refusals\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this; 'nothing at all except refusals' entails no successes.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-035\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not explicitly state whose budget is wasted.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-036\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A cap can be raised\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-037\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A cap can be raised, but only with measurement\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states caps require measurement, contradicting assertion-only increases.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-038\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not explicitly state the team examines load characteristics before examining the cap number.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-039\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this; 'go to' and 'reach' are synonymous.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-040\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"There is no expedited path\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this.\"\n  